This is an independent, clean-room asynchronous MCP server and LangGraph toolkit for the
Everesteer API (https://api.everesteer.ai). All REST endpoints, request/response schemas,
micro-USDC validation semantics, and submission contracts follow the publicly published
MIT-licensed official SDK:

